# @REPO@

Check everything: `scripts/check` (lint, types, boundaries, tests, test quality, mutation floor). Run it before saying you're done; `scripts/check --fast` skips mutation.

- Module boundaries: import other modules only through their entry points; `scripts/check boundaries` enforces it.@PACKAGES_POINTER@
- Coding standards are applied at review: [CODING_STANDARDS.md](CODING_STANDARDS.md). Read it if you want; the reviewer enforces it.
- Tickets and specs: [docs/agents/issue-tracker.md](docs/agents/issue-tracker.md). Domain docs: [docs/agents/domain.md](docs/agents/domain.md).
- Writing tests: `tdd` skill. Fixing a bug: `diagnosing-bugs` skill. Opening a PR: `pr` skill. Whole ticket: `/implement-ticket`.
- Door rules (what needs human review): [.claude/door-rules.yml](.claude/door-rules.yml).
